<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE NEXT WEEK - CPI, retail, wholesale.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE NEXT WEEK - CPI, retail, wholesale.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following German economic indicators are expected to be released next week, the Federal Statistics Office said:</p>
<p> INDICATOR	   PERIOD	 PREVIOUS DATA	  DUE DATE</p>
<p> Final inflation   Oct   Oct prelim +1.5, Sept +1.4  Nov 11</p>
<p> Retail sales	Aug	  Jul +2.5 y/y real	Nov 11</p>
<p> Wholesale prices  Oct   Sept -0.7 y/y, -0.1 m/m     Nov 12</p>
<p>NOTE - Expected release dates are targets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
